{"id":"faculty-aruna_shukla:e0012","type":"paragraph","page":1,"text":"Dr. Aruna Shukla is an Assistant Professor in the Department of Humanities and Management at IIIT Naya Raipur on a contract basis. She holds a Ph.D. in Indian English Literature from NIT Raipur. She has one year of teaching experience at SSIPMT Raipur. She has published several research papers with Scopus and MLA indexing in esteemed journals. Dr. Shukla is a member of the English Language Teachers' Association of India (ELTAI). She has contributed to the academic community through her research and teaching. Her areas of expertise include Narratology, Indian English Literature, communication skills, and Personality Development.","bbox":null,"level":null,"table":null,"reader":"markdown","confidence":null,"order":0,"attrs":{},"status":"extracted","reasons":[]}
